{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53000","headline":"七言登北山寺西阁楼冯禅师茶酌赠崔少府一首 · 李嘉佑","name":"七言登北山寺西阁楼冯禅师茶酌赠崔少府一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开[士]（土）相逢暮饮茶，高楼并坐望三巴。\n碧嶂不知何劫石，清江流尽几恒沙。\n鑪烟处处香慈竹，溪雨朝朝润觉花。\n道胜自然长法喜，应令迁客小沩华。\n（均见日本藏唐抄本《唐诗卷》）（按：《咸淳毘陵志》卷二十二收嘉佑《寄毘陵彻公》诗，《全唐诗》卷五七三收作贾岛诗，孰作尚难确定，姑附识於此，以俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}